--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- V17__seed_firm5_c1wealth_data.sql
--
-- Loads firm 5 (CreativeOne Wealth / c1wealth) with a small, connected slice of
-- real-shaped data so the firm is no longer an empty config shell. Before this,
-- firm 5 had its firm-config closure (V8) but ZERO entities; firmAdmin/users/5
-- listed no users and the firm had no clients/accounts.
--
-- The slice (the V2/V3/V4 "established approach", see db/tools/seed-pipeline.md):
--   * one advisor login user (LDAP_UID 'bavis', ENTITY_TYPE 4, GW_ADMIN_FLAG=1,
--     MFA off, active, NOT inactivated) — so firmAdmin/users/5 lists a user and
--     someone can log in. NOTE getActiveUsers (NEntityDAO.loadAllActiveEmployees)
--     filters `entityActiveFlag is true AND entityInactivatedDate is null`, so the
--     advisor's ENTITY_INACTIVE_DATE / LOGIN_INACTIVATED_DATE are NULLed here (the
--     real row was a deactivated account);
--   * one household (ENTITY_TYPE 5) + its individual owner (ENTITY_TYPE 1);
--   * one managed account (NF_ACCOUNT + ACCOUNT_DETAILS), its two entity-account
--     roles (owner + household), and its 5 tax-lot positions + 2 instruments;
--   * two VIEW(CLIENT) POLICY_RULE rows so the advisor can see the client.
--
-- Provenance : a real connected slice extracted from the qa source
--              (qa4db / ORCL12VM, GP, FIRM_CD=5) — ids/codes/relationships/flags
--              are real. PII-SCRUBBED for this public repo: person/household/
--              company names replaced with deterministic Faker values; tax ids,
--              SSNs, credit-card, phones, birthdates and address ids NULLed;
--              emails were already @fake.net upstream. LDAP_PSWD_HASH is blank
--              (the demo hash is set locally by the gitignored db/local/R__,
--              which already covers firm 5). The advisor carries no role/access-
--              set yet (capability grants are a separate concern, cf. V14).
--              INSTRUMENT_MASTER rows are shared reference data, so those inserts
--              are NOT EXISTS-guarded (the cash pseudo-instrument already exists).
-- Requires   : V8 (firm 5 + its config closure). Plain INSERTs for the firm-
--              private rows (a versioned migration runs once), matching V2/V3/V4.
-- Generated  : 2026-06-01.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

